# Everything `dagger generate` writes into this module, so it stays out of diffs
# and language stats. The first three lines are codegen's own: it appends any of
# them that is missing, so they stay as it writes them. go.mod and go.sum are
# this repository's addition, because codegen rewrites both from the Go SDK's
# template for the engineVersion in dagger-module.toml (#429).
/dagger.gen.go linguist-generated
/internal/dagger/** linguist-generated
/internal/telemetry/** linguist-generated
/go.mod linguist-generated
/go.sum linguist-generated
